feedback.description:
Shows the last status messages sent from the sensor to the DP, if any.
Includes information on upgrades, malware uploads, and Windows log file configuration.
The same information is visible in the Sensor Overview by enabling the Feedback column and clicking the Show Feedback button.
Here is a sample feedback section in the API output:

feedback: {
 upgrade: {
   status:,
   timestamp:,
   image
 },
 nessus-collector: {
   msg,
   status:
   timestamp,
 },
 customer_malware_analyze: {
   orig_name,
   task,
   status,
   timestamp,
   file_name,
   engine_id,
   msg,
   tenant_id
 }
}

